{"sourceUrl":"https://cmse.buct.edu.cn/2026/0708/c4117a221247/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:52.486716+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cmse.buct.edu.cn/2026/0708/c4117a221247/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><h1><br/></h1><p><span><span>为增进国内高校优秀大学生对北京化工大学材料科学与工程学院的认知，我院计划于</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>日举办优秀大学生暑期</span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span><span>夏令营活动。此次活动旨在为广大优秀学子提供一个深入了解我院</span></span><span><span>发展历史、</span></span><span><span>科研实力、师资队伍、实验条件等各方面的平台，同时也为学生们提供一个互相交流、拓宽视野、提升自身综合素质的机会。我们诚挚地邀请全国各高校材料、化学、化工等相关学科的优秀学子踊跃报名参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>本次暑期夏令营将安排一系列丰富多彩的活动，包括学术报告、师生</span></span><span><span>交流</span></span><span><span>会等。通过这些活动，同学们将有机会与我院专家学者</span></span><span><span>线上</span></span><span><span>交流，了解材料科学与工程领域的前沿动态，感受北京化工大学浓厚的学术氛围。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>一、申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）拥护中国共产党领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）品德良好，遵纪守法，学习期间未受过任何处分；身心健康，勤奋好学，思维敏捷，具有较强的科研创新能力和学术实践能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）学习成绩优秀、综合表现优异、英语水平良好的</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>届本科毕业。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>二、报名流程</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者请于</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>日中午</span></span><span><span>12</span></span><span><span>点前，登录北京化工大学研究生报考服务系统（</span></span><span><span>https://yzbm.buct.edu.cn/logon</span></span><span><span>），选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营”进行注册报名。同时在报名系统中上传以下材料电子版，材料要精简明了，保证图文清晰。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）提交个人简历一份（格式不限）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）成绩排名证明（注明专业总人数和排名，需教务部门盖章）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）本科生成绩单（需教务部门盖章）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）英语水平证明材料（如四</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>六级、托福、雅思等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）科研能力相关证明材料（如获奖证书、发表论文等）。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://cmse.buct.edu.cn/2026/0708/c4117a221247/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>学院将对申请者材料进行初审，初审通过后营员可通过报名系统“申请状态查询”模块查询本人是否入围线上夏令营，对于审核通过的营员须于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>点前，在线上夏令营报名系统中点击“确认参营”，对于逾期不确认参营的申请者将取消其参营资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>三、活动安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营为线上方式举办，于</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日进行，为期</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>天，主要包含学科宣讲、学术讲座、师生交流等活动，活动具体包括以下内容：</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>日期</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>活动</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>具体内容</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>:00-</span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>:30</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学院简介</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>主要介绍学院历史、学科发展、人才培养、教学科研等情况。</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span>:30-1</span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span>:00</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业方向介绍</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>各学科方向教授介绍研究方向与学术前沿</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>14:0</span></span></span><span><span>0-1</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span>:00</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>师生交流</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>营员和</span></span><span><span><span>老师</span></span></span><span><span>线上自由交流</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>具体会议链接另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>四、说明</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人参营资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>五、联系方式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>cailiaozs@mail.buct.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>010-64433854</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>材料科学与工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e7fa3ef06391115708a38a4fcdbeacd17272e6193e69a854d864daae30701bf5","textLength":1119,"sourceSha256":"3b94b648a143f27cb43d33ae0aa78c9312a1dfd945da40c3201ad130eed9dd65","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-df97034baa391e075d32","title":"2026年北京化工大学材料科学与工程学院优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:52.486716+00:00"}
